s font-mono text-sm leading-6 text-slate-100">### REQ-XXX-001: Requirement =
Name
**User Story:** As a [role], I want to [action], so that [outcome].
**Acceptance Criteria:**
* **AC-XXX-001.1:** When the user [action], the system shall [behavior].
* **AC-XXX-001.2:** When [condition], the system shall [behavior].</code></=
pre></div><p class=3D"text-wrap font-ibm-plex font-light !text-base md:!tex=
t-[1.15rem] !text-stone-200 not-first:mt-[1.25em] leading-7">It is assumed =
that the author of a Feature Blueprint has read the corresponding Requireme=
nts Document. The Feature Blueprint provides the technical path for satisfy=
ing those requirements; no formal cross-referencing is required.</p><a clas=
s=3D"group relative block tracking-none scroll-mt-[85px] -ml-8 pl-8 text-in=
herit" id=3D"structure" href=3D"https://www.8090.ai/docs/opinions/blueprint=
