=E2=80=94 Add <code>## Feature-Specific Components</code> for components th=
at exist only for this feature (panels, pages, feature-specific hooks); giv=
e these full component blocks. Use relationship paragraphs between componen=
t blocks when direction, data flow, or intent is not obvious from colocatio=
n.  </li><li class=3D"list-item font-ibm-plex-sans font-light !text-base md=
:!text-[1.15rem] !text-stone-200 not-first:mt-[1.25em] leading-7"><strong><=
strong>System Contracts</strong></strong> =E2=80=94 Add <code>## System Con=
tracts</code> to capture the feature's guarantees and behavioral rules. Org=
anize with <code>### Key Contracts</code> (invariants, correctness rules, r=
eliability semantics) and <code>### Integration Contracts</code> (events, A=
PIs, composition expectations specific to this feature).  </li><li class=3D=
"list-item font-ibm-plex-sans font-light !text-base md:!text-[1.15rem] !tex=
t-stone-200 not-first:mt-[1.25em] leading-7"><strong><strong>Architecture D=
