ion Records</code> for non-obvious design choices and trade-offs. Each entr=
y is a <code>###</code> heading in the format <code>### ADR-NNN: Title</cod=
e>, followed by three labeled paragraphs: <strong><strong>Context</strong><=
/strong> (why the decision was needed), <strong><strong>Decision</strong></=
strong> (what was chosen and how), <strong><strong>Consequences</strong></s=
trong> (trade-offs, benefits, and implications). Number ADRs sequentially w=
