first:mt-[1.25em] leading-7"><strong><strong>Composition-first.</strong></s=
trong> Container Blueprints define deployment units; Component Blueprints d=
efine reusable capabilities within and across them; Feature Blueprints comp=
ose those capabilities and add feature-specific components only where neede=
d.  </li><li class=3D"list-item font-ibm-plex-sans font-light !text-base md=
:!text-[1.15rem] !text-stone-200 not-first:mt-[1.25em] leading-7"><strong><=
strong>Structured and narrative.</strong></strong> Structured blocks provid=
